Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:09.18,Default,Prisoner B,0,0,0,,These stupid things are coming right at us, \Nbegging to be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:12.37,Default,Prisoner C,0,0,0,,Well, I love it! Let's wipe 'em all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:17.04,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I'm not sure which ones \Nare the real beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:22.00,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Old Man Song's a beast himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.85,0:00:32.34,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,That takes care of this group. \NYou really have gotten stronger, Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:35.13,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,And where did you get such a nice dagger?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:40.93,Default,Prisoner B,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, \Nyou haven't been hurt at all today, Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.93,0:00:42.73,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I-Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.73,0:00:45.52,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Here's hoping no one ends up needing my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.99,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Well, I'm still counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.99,0:00:50.70,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,He definitely has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.31,0:00:56.12,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Not just his appearance but even his aura... \NHe's making it look easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.12,0:00:58.58,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Did you start learning martial arts?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.21,0:01:01.12,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:35.22,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,The path splits here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:38.05,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,The dungeon's been easier than forecast,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:40.21,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,so it should be fine \Nto split into three groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:44.53,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,There'd be additional risk, \Nbut we'd be able to finish sooner, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.53,0:02:45.94,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I think that's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:48.86,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I'll take the prisoners down \Nthe path on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:52.36,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,If you find the boss chamber, \Nsend someone to let us know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:56.74,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess it's because I raised my perception \Nability, but I can tell already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:02:59.41,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The boss is down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.21,0:03:02.77,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,These goblins weren't getting me \Nmuch experience, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.40,0:03:04.55,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Mr. Song.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.55,0:03:06.61,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Let's head down the path to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.61,0:03:07.50,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:09.55,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,That leaves the middle for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.55,0:03:10.59,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:24.23,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,If these goblins are all \Nthere is, we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.23,0:03:27.34,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,I just hope we can finish this job safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.34,0:03:28.57,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I'm sure we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:33.15,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,The Weakest Hunter only gets called in \Nfor low-rank dungeons, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.15,0:03:37.26,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,Except we made that same assumption \Nonce already, and look what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.85,0:03:40.82,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:45.67,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,When this raid's over, \NI'm gonna apologize to Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.92,0:03:50.92,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,It's been bugging you, too, right? \NHow we ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.72,0:03:54.16,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,We're grown men, professional hunters...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.93,0:03:57.12,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Even if it was because of our families,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:04:00.40,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,that doesn't change the fact that \Nwe left one of our own behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:05.10,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,If we wanna keep being hunters... \Nwe need to face up to what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:09.69,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,You think he'll forgive us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.69,0:04:13.60,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,There's no chance. \NBut I'm still gonna apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.10,0:04:16.02,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:21.67,Default,Prisoner C,0,0,0,,What a joke! These goblins are way too easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:23.53,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Is that all of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.53,0:04:25.25,Default,Prisoner B,0,0,0,,You expected it to take longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:27.24,Default,Prisoner C,0,0,0,,I wanna rack up some more kills!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.50,0:04:31.83,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,What if you were facing humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.91,0:04:34.59,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Could you kill them just as easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:38.05,Default,Prisoner B,0,0,0,,I don't really see the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.05,0:04:40.33,Default,Prisoner C,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's all the same shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.51,0:04:43.27,Flashback,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,What did you want to discuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:47.73,Flashback,Certain Executive,0,0,0,,Three men... assaulted my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:50.47,Flashback,Certain Executive,0,0,0,,She hung herself afterwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.47,0:04:52.98,Flashback,Certain Executive,0,0,0,,and my wife was hospitalized \Nfrom the psychological shock...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:58.49,Flashback,Certain Executive,0,0,0,,But these scum will be free in a few years, \Nlike nothing happened at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.49,0:05:01.49,Flashback,Certain Executive,0,0,0,,Not only that, but they're hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:04.53,Flashback,Certain Executive,0,0,0,,Hunters are allowed to participate \Nin raids while incarcerated
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.53,0:05:06.60,Flashback,Certain Executive,0,0,0,,to reduce their sentences, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:09.53,Flashback,Certain Executive,0,0,0,,In what world is that fair?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.53,0:05:12.51,Flashback,Certain Executive,0,0,0,,When my daughter will never get to come home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:16.34,Flashback,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,And that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:18.63,Flashback,Certain Executive,0,0,0,,I have three billion here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:21.83,Flashback,Certain Executive,0,0,0,,I want you... to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:24.46,Flashback,Certain Executive,0,0,0,,kill them, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:29.68,Flashback,Certain Executive,0,0,0,,What happens in a dungeon \Nstays in the dungeon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.27,0:05:33.18,Flashback,Certain Executive,0,0,0,,Please! I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.27,0:05:39.90,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Here's what I'll tell the inspectors \Nwhen I get out of here:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:45.48,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,The three of you were set upon \Nby a pack of a hundred goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:49.20,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,This path really goes all over the place...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.20,0:05:51.19,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,Are we even making any progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.19,0:05:53.42,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,You think we got the dud route?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:54.83,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Here we go...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:05:59.25,Default,Prisoner B,0,0,0,,Help... me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:01.51,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Hoping for a quick death?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:06.75,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I was actually asked to make you \Nsuffer as much as possible first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:08.74,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.04,0:06:12.64,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Huh. I guess the paths met back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:16.96,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Which means the left path \Nwas the one that led to the boss room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.49,0:06:19.50,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,That'll save me some trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:20.63,Default,Prisoner B,0,0,0,,Hel—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.85,0:06:23.86,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Guess I'll have to alter my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:33.80,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That Kang Taeshik guy visited me in \Nthe hospital with his inspector boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.75,0:06:37.58,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I hope he doesn't remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.53,0:06:40.42,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Mr. Song!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:41.32,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:48.76,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.12,0:06:52.26,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Jeongho!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:56.40,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Mr. Kang...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.62,0:07:12.12,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Mr. Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.91,0:07:14.87,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Joohee, heal him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:16.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Hurry and heal him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:18.54,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.57,0:07:23.96,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Mr. Kim! Please hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:27.18,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,This wasn't the work of a magic beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:32.14,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,The weapon's too sharp. And whoever used it \Navoided finishing him off... multiple times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.59,0:07:37.10,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Don't... bother. I'm not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:39.47,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:43.18,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You need to survive. \NYou have a family, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.02,0:07:45.57,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.57,0:07:51.03,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You need to survive, no matter what! \NHow else can I keep blaming you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.85,0:07:55.50,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I really am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:59.83,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I didn't see it playing out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:04.17,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I wanted to give you... a proper apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.87,0:08:08.14,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I'm real sorry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:11.24,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I mean... it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.65,0:08:21.00,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Kim...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:32.53,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Wow, you're fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:37.91,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I had intended on taking out \Nthe healer first...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:41.67,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,But it looks like you were able \Nto change her fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:45.03,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Mr. Kang?! Did you do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.03,0:08:46.38,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,What if I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:49.69,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Aren't you from the Hunter's Association?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.69,0:08:51.08,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,You think you can get away with—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.08,0:08:53.05,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I've got the perfect little story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.86,0:08:59.56,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I was gonna say that it was a swarm \Nof goblins, but here's my new angle:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.22,0:09:04.71,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,The prisoners were plotting an escape, \Nso they killed the rest of you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:09.15,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,and then tried to ambush me while \NI was occupied fighting the boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.53,0:09:14.74,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,But they didn't have what it takes. \NAnd that's why I was the sole survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.74,0:09:16.58,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,What do you think? Perfect, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:18.20,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:22.37,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,You can't stand against him. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:25.30,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I'm borrowing this, Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.23,0:09:28.80,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I haven't raised a sword against \Nanother person in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:32.25,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,He's B-Rank, a level above me. But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.81,0:09:36.25,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Ms. Joohee, could you cast a \Nphysical strength buff on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:37.60,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:40.97,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Assassin types tend to have weak defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.44,0:09:43.10,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I'll aim for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:48.36,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,A washed-up mage like you trying to rely \Non strength instead is gonna backfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:50.74,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:57.74,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,But your skills are magic-focused! \NTaking up that sword won't help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.89,0:10:02.96,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,You might be surprised!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.52,0:10:05.08,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Okay, you've got some moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.54,0:10:09.09,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Even putting aside the buff, \Nyou really do know your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.62,0:10:12.34,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It was only for a moment, \Nbut he was able to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:15.18,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If Mr. Song was a little faster...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.18,0:10:19.60,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Fast and accurate! I can see why \Nyou ditched magic for the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.83,0:10:23.04,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,But that's about all you can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.40,0:10:29.15,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,That pain-in-the-ass healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.47,0:10:31.36,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Guess I had better deal with her after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.82,0:10:38.49,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Turning your back on an armed opponent?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:41.58,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I guess you're no average old fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:44.82,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I've trained S-Rank hunters before!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:47.08,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,In terms of blade technique, I won't be beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:50.87,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Maybe, but the powers you've \Nbeen given have their limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:56.76,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Did you think a mage type like you \Ncould keep up with an assassin hunter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:02.57,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Mr. Song!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.86,0:11:05.89,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.89,0:11:09.36,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Your healer's useless, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:14.56,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:22.83,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Did that work?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.24,0:11:27.12,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,You took up that sword to make me \Nlower my guard against magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:30.92,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,so that when I went for the kill, \Nyou could blast me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:35.22,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Pretty slick plan, for a senile old bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.22,0:11:36.80,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I'm finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:38.39,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Now die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.85,0:11:46.71,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,You again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.71,0:11:47.94,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:52.10,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Sung Jinwoo, E-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:56.95,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,E-Rank? That's a load of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:12:00.16,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Sung? What was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:05.16,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I could see a power type, even at E-Rank, \Nbeing able to block like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:09.07,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,But the reaction time you'd \Nneed to pull it off twice...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.07,0:12:10.17,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,would require an assassin build.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.59,0:12:15.26,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Not that it really matters, anyway. \NYou've been hiding your skills, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:17.68,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Your little group seems to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.68,0:12:22.48,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,So you can't be a false ranker. \NThey don't let any witnesses live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.48,0:12:25.29,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Which leaves only one possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.01,0:12:27.44,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,You had a second awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:28.52,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,You did, Sung?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:29.69,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,A second awakening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.39,0:12:33.82,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Then it must've happened \Nafter the double dungeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:35.73,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,A double dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.04,0:12:39.09,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Wait... Is he that weakling \NE-Rank from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:42.89,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,But he looks and acts like a different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.89,0:12:45.70,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,And the mana meter only read 10 \Nwhen we checked back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:48.26,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,If he had a second awakening, \Nit must have been after.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.26,0:12:51.67,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,So how'd he survive the double dungeon...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.13,0:12:56.74,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Well, whatever happened to you, I can tell \Nyou don't have a ton of hunting experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.74,0:12:59.59,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,So it falls to me to teach you the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.98,0:13:01.68,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Why did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:03.76,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,You mean killing the prisoners?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:07.56,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I was asked to by the father of their victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.56,0:13:11.21,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,They drove someone to suicide \Nand didn't regret it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.21,0:13:13.15,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,It's a bit of social justice, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:15.90,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No. I was talking about Mr. Kim and Mr. Kang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.27,0:13:17.44,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Why kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.11,0:13:21.66,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Was it to silence them? Because you \Ncould've done that without torturing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.22,0:13:26.36,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But you didn't do that. You toyed with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.91,0:13:29.62,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I don't think you did this \Nfor the victim's sake at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:32.08,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's not what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.65,0:13:38.03,Flashback,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Sure, I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.45,0:13:40.49,Flashback,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,But you've got the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:45.47,Flashback,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I'm a B-Rank hunter who has received \Noffers from a number of major guilds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.15,0:13:50.42,Flashback,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,So why am I working for peanuts \Nin the Hunter's Association?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.93,0:13:57.69,Flashback,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,It's because I find people a {\i1}whole{\i0} \Nlot more fun to kill than beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:03.75,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,There's a limit to what even a \Nreawakened E-Rank can pull off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:06.62,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:07.99,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.52,0:14:13.16,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,He's so agile!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.63,0:14:17.57,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Nothing at all like the Sung I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.26,0:14:21.97,DefaultItalics,Sung/Kang,0,0,0,,We're matched in speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:25.84,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,We've got the same build \Nand similar skill levels...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:29.49,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,But I have far more experience battling \Nhigh-ranked opponents than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.49,0:14:32.48,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,That inexperience will be your downfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.90,0:14:41.91,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,You've got grit, I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.91,0:14:43.31,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.31,0:14:43.86,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.86,0:14:46.87,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But could you be a little less bloodthirsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:51.04,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Now you've done it. \NEven the system's noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:54.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Then again, I guess I should be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.97,0:14:58.59,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The system's given me another reason \Nto make sure you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:00.25,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,The system?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:01.67,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,What the hell is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:04.63,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I should have the advantage here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.15,0:15:12.68,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,He's even faster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:16.65,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Poison? A special effect \Nfrom that dagger of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.23,0:15:23.99,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I've got something special to show you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.53,0:15:27.03,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,He vanished?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:30.99,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I should be completely undetectable. \NYou're a sharp bastard, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.40,0:15:36.44,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,This is the Stealth skill. It conceals \Nmy sight, my sound, and even my smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:40.74,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Only a tiny fraction of assassin \Nhunters ever obtain this skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:45.48,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Of course, no one knows I can use it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:46.52,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,And the reason for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.77,0:15:53.72,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,is that no one who's seen me use it \Nhas ever lived to tell the tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:56.23,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,You won't be so fast now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:15:57.85,DefaultTop,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Jinwoo—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.05,0:15:58.76,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Keep your hands to yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.61,0:16:02.15,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,You two are next.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.57,0:16:05.07,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,At this rate, Sung's going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.07,0:16:09.29,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Now, think you can dodge my next strike \Nwith an injured leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.29,0:16:12.24,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Are you done talking now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.60,0:16:14.03,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Full recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:18.00,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,He healed in an instant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.00,0:16:22.34,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I've never heard of a combat hunter \Nwho could use healing magic, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.65,0:16:24.46,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,What else does he have?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:27.55,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,He's impossible to predict! \NThis guy is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.89,0:16:30.12,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's another of my emotions, gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:34.85,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I don't even need to get angry \Nto kill filth like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:40.02,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. You've killed before, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.67,0:16:44.12,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Man, I didn't know we were \Nin the same business!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.52,0:16:45.77,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.77,0:16:50.61,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,He must've been forced through a number \Nof grave decisions in a short time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:53.83,DefaultItalics,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,It wasn't just his appearance that changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:58.58,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,When hunters awakened, their supernatural \Nabilities turned the world on its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:03.59,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Where we are is a place that only hunters \Ncan enter. Laws aren't worth shit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.82,0:17:06.16,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Whoever's strongest comes out on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:15.71,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Is he tracking me from my bloodlust?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:18.99,DefaultItalics,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,But that won't let him know \Nexactly where I'm coming from!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:25.20,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,What the—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:29.78,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Wait... Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:36.56,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,What... the hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.57,0:17:45.72,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,You asked why I killed them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:52.66,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,It's pointless to expect hunters, who thrive \Nin mortal combat, to stick to normal morals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:59.47,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,You're the same way. You and me, \Nwe're killing machines at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.91,0:18:02.91,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Which is why I'll die. Because I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.91,0:18:05.56,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,It's just natural selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.26,0:18:08.46,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,But what the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:12.03,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,You've got assassin skills, \Nhealing, and debuffs...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:13.53,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I've never heard of anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.91,0:18:17.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Couldn't tell you. I'd like to know, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.29,0:18:28.21,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Well, you just killed me, \Nso your little E-Rank act is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.21,0:18:32.28,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Let's say that I'm a hunter \Nwho gets stronger with every battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.14,0:18:39.96,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Then I'd say your shadow stretches \Ninto some really nasty places...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.44,0:18:44.34,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,and you'll probably get as strong \Nas those places are dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:47.40,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,You'd better watch yourself, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:55.88,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,If you gaze for long into an abyss, \Nthe abyss... gazes also into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.87,0:19:05.97,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,He's right. I'm incomparably strong \Nnext to how I was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:08.21,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But for some reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:14.33,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,the stronger I get, the more I feel \Nsomething inside of me falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:15.55,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.55,0:19:17.42,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.83,0:19:22.23,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,You really did it.\NWe only survived because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.23,0:19:25.59,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's fine. You two should exit the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.30,0:19:27.73,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:30.02,Default,Sung Chiyul,0,0,0,,What?! By yourself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.71,0:19:32.61,Default,Sung Chiyul,0,0,0,,Then again... you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:37.24,Default,Sung Chiyul,0,0,0,,It's a shame we won't be able \Nto lay Kim and Kang to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.24,0:19:38.70,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.54,0:19:51.63,Default,Lady Associate,0,0,0,,Manager Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.63,0:19:53.97,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,I heard the report. Where are the survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.97,0:19:55.34,Default,Lady Associate,0,0,0,,Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.34,0:20:01.05,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,I can't believe Kang was \Nkilling in secret all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:06.76,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,He had always been a little sketchy, \Nbut as his supervisor, I was too careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.61,0:20:09.10,Default,Lady Associate,0,0,0,,This is the three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.93,0:20:14.28,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Isn't he... the E-Rank hunter from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.75,0:20:16.36,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,He looks like a whole different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:18.76,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,It's good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.76,0:20:20.66,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Aren't you the inspector...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.66,0:20:25.40,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Woo Jinchul. I want to apologize for what \None of my men put you through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.05,0:20:29.92,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,But first... I'd like \Nto address the main issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.92,0:20:33.38,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Which one of you defeated Kang?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.38,0:20:36.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess I won't be able to keep \Nmy secret any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:41.39,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Which means I'm gonna have to \Ncancel my deal with Jinho...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.01,0:20:43.35,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.81,0:20:46.32,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I killed Mr. Kang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.68,0:20:49.02,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but I believe your rank was...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:50.54,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,C-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.54,0:20:53.56,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,How were you able to beat \Na B-Rank like Kang?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:56.28,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Why, with the help of my friend here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.45,0:21:01.49,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,I see. Then you say you \Nmanaged with a healer's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.58,0:21:05.17,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Kang was the cream of the crop among B-Ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.17,0:21:08.71,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,By all rights, a C-Rank mage \Nshouldn't have stood a chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.13,0:21:11.54,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:16.00,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,I'll need to write this incident up, \Nso if you could please come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.40,0:21:19.86,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can't get cocky just because \NI beat Kang Taeshik.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:24.06,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell before, \Nbut this guy is A-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.06,0:21:26.20,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,As it stands, I'd be helpless against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.58,0:21:30.36,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Sorry if I overstepped my bounds there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.27,0:21:35.23,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,But I imagine you've got a good reason \Nfor keeping your strength hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:40.70,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Well, think of it as my way \Nof paying you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.09,0:21:46.53,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Three hours later,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.53,0:21:50.25,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,the man who hired Kang Taeshik \Nto kill the prisoners turned himself in,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.25,0:21:52.83,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,which confirmed that \Nwe acted in self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.92,0:21:56.88,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What a day, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.63,0:21:58.80,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:03.95,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Do you remember this?
